"""
api/data/portraits/ascii_cache.py
──────────────────────────────────
Pre-computed fine-character ANSI TrueColor ASCII portraits and in-place morphing engine for Marcus Webb.
Features:
  - Pure ASCII text typography (no chunky half-block pixels, native terminal background).
  - Adaptive dimensions: 46x26 (wide) and 32x18 (compact for split-screen).
  - High-dynamic-range face framing with clear facial features (eyes, eyebrows, mouth, expressions).
  - In-place TrueColor 8x8 Bayer dithered morph transitions.
"""

